Package: gstreamer
Version: 0.8.7-r0
Description: GStreamer is a multimedia framework for encoding and decoding video and sound. It supports a wide range of formats including mp3, ogg, avi, mpeg and quicktime.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/src/gstreamer/gstreamer-0.8.7.tar.bz2 	file://gstreamer.xsession
Depends: gstreamer-locale*, libglib-2.0-0 (>= 2.4.7), libpopt0 (>= 1.7), libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1), libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726), gstreamer (>= 0.8.7), libxml2 (>= 2.6.10), libz1 (>= 1.1.4)
